  _entries:
  - key: guard_request_1
    value: Please provide the required documents.
  - key: guard_request_2
    value: Hand me the required documents.
  - key: guard_good_doc_1
    value: Thank you.
  - key: guard_good_doc_2
    value: Very well.
  - key: guard_bad_doc_1
    value: "I'm starting to think you're suspicious\u2026"
  - key: guard_bad_doc_2
    value: Wrong document.
  - key: guard_bad_doc_3
    value: My patience has limits.
  - key: guard_checkpoint_pass_1
    value: Documents are in order.
  - key: guard_checkpoint_pass_2
    value: Safe travels.
  - key: guard_checkpoint_pass_3
    value: You're clear, move along.
  - key: guard_checkpoint_fail
    value: Step out of the vehicle, hands up, you're under arrest!
  - key: guard_next_post
    value: At the next checkpoint, you'll need to present these documents.
  - key: guard_first_checkpoint
    value: You'll need these forms to pass the next checkpoint, remember them!
  - key: feedback_dodge
    value: Dodge!
  - key: feedback_despair
    value: You don't have the forms?!
