  - key: item_liasse_nom
    value: Wad of cash
  - key: item_passe_nom
    value: All-access form
  - key: item_badge_nom
    value: Government badge
  - key: item_tirelire_nom
    value: Piggy bank
  - key: item_gateau_nom
    value: Fortune cookie
  - key: item_radar_nom
    value: Obstacle radar
  - key: item_aspirateur_nom
    value: Vacuum
  - key: item_montre_nom
    value: Pocket watch
  - key: item_liasse_desc
    value: The wad of cash bribes the guard, raising his patience meter by 50%.
  - key: item_passe_desc
    value: The all-access form allows you to clear a document at the checkpoint.
  - key: item_badge_desc
    value: The government badge allows you to pass through any checkpoint.
  - key: item_tirelire_desc
    value: The piggy bank lets you double your coins for 20 seconds.
  - key: item_gateau_desc
    value: The fortune cookie gives you a 50% chance of passing through an obstacle
      for 20 seconds.
  - key: item_radar_desc
    value: The obstacle radar lets you see upcoming obstacles for 20 seconds, indicated
      by a "!" at the top of the screen.
  - key: item_aspirateur_desc
    value: The vacuum gives you more time to suck up documents for 20 seconds.
  - key: item_montre_desc
    value: The pocket watch slows down time by 50% for 20 seconds.
  - key: skin_0_nom
    value: Basic Car
  - key: skin_1_nom
    value: Kitsch
  - key: skin_2_nom
    value: Blue Car
  - key: skin_3_nom
    value: Blaze
  - key: skin_4_nom
    value: Catmobile
  - key: skin_5_nom
    value: Divacar
  - key: skin_6_nom
    value: Naturemobile
  - key: skin_7_nom
    value: Lovecar
  - key: skin_8_nom
    value: Alphacar
  - key: skin_9_nom
    value: Government Car
  - key: skin_10_nom
    value: Racecar
  - key: skin_11_nom
    value: Red Car
  - key: skin_12_nom
    value: Rustbucket
  - key: skin_13_nom
    value: Wavemobile
  - key: skin_14_nom
    value: Purple Car
  - key: skin_15_nom
    value: L.I.F.E
  - key: skin_0_desc
    value: The basic car, its azure blue is the perfect camouflage to hide in the
      sky!
  - key: skin_1_desc
    value: A bit dated, but it brings back memories of a bygone era...
  - key: skin_2_desc
    value: Despite its deep-sea blue, this car definitely cannot swim.
  - key: skin_3_desc
    value: This car burns like an ember! Every cool person dreams of having one!
  - key: skin_4_desc
    value: Everyone loves little cats! Just don't let them drive without proper authorisation.
  - key: skin_5_desc
    value: A car for people of taste! Even if it doesn't suit everyone's taste.
  - key: skin_6_desc
    value: Faced with the growing problem of people staying cooped up indoors, the
      greatest inventors created this car that brings the outdoors with you!
  - key: skin_7_desc
    value: What is more beautiful than love? This car, without a doubt.
  - key: skin_8_desc
    value: All cars follow and adore it, at least that's what it thinks.
  - key: skin_9_desc
    value: The official government car. Makes you wonder how it ended up here...
  - key: skin_10_desc
    value: They say it once belonged to a great driver, but since the major speed
      restrictions came in, he's been out of work.
  - key: skin_11_desc
    value: A red car. Nothing special.
  - key: skin_12_desc
    value: Nobody knows how this thing is still running, or how it keeps passing
      its MOT.
  - key: skin_13_desc
    value: Its pattern is reminiscent of waves.
  - key: skin_14_desc
    value: In many cultures its colour symbolises evil. The government even considered
      banning it.
  - key: skin_15_desc
    value: They say its driver sorted papers for a living. A thrilling career.
  - key: tuto_barrage_corps
    value: 'At each checkpoint, hand the guard the requested documents before the
      patience bar at the top of the screen runs out. Here, give him a red document.


      Once
      all documents are handed over, the guard will tell you which ones to prepare
      for the next inspection.'
  - key: tuto_barrage_bouton
    value: Back to menu
  - key: tuto_felicitations_titre
    value: Congratulations!
  - key: tuto_felicitations_corps
    value: 'You are ready to go through the checkpoints!


      Good luck!'
  - key: tuto_felicitations_bouton
    value: Back to menu
  - key: tuto_road_goal
    value: 'Drive to escape the bureaucracy! Cross the city and collect the right
      documents.


      Avoid obstacles to stay on the road.

      Checkpoints
      require specific documents, keep an eye on what you need!'
  - key: tuto_road_swipe
    value: Swipe left or right to change lanes!
  - key: tuto_road_pieces
    value: 'On the road, collect coins by driving over them.


      You can use
      these coins to buy useful items in the shop!'
  - key: tuto_road_document
    value: 'Here is the document you will need for the next checkpoint.


      Each
      checkpoint will tell you which documents to collect. Drive alongside cars of
      the right colour and tap the screen at the right moment to grab their document!
      A red car gives a red document, etc.'
  - key: tuto_road_slider
    value: 'This bar shows your progress until the next checkpoint.


      When
      it is full, the inspection begins!


      For this tutorial, you will be taken
      directly to the checkpoint.'
  - key: tuto_road_prix
    value: Price
  - key: tuto_road_continuer
    value: Continue
